#: scenario5:scenario5_231177F8_A960_411F_BAD4_D4A6BF6A7379
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 32edc8b2d8e403873296a8fd629b52ffdd71d241b1dea8fee0657d32c45e3399
