#: scenario5:scenario5_82BBF69C_0AA9_4DFA_BC35_4C07A8FFD1EB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 414d4328784fee2f325a4ba1c8edd1e249ab77e5ba248917cac5b869717e5474
