#: scenario5:scenario5_AE7C1CB4_95F7_4057_8995_BE29E66375D5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: da97124c680aba3133110e34006e4547b9737b377d7c9b3a9396b8bbd2dd7fb1
